      be \n  substituted by a Scatter during Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=22>- During Free Games, the special expanding symbol may expand
      to cover 3 positions \n  on the reel.\n- Special expanding symbol will pay like
      regular symbol, but even on non-adjacent \n  positions and on all lines played.\n-
      Expanding is only triggered if there are enough symbols present to create a
      win."
